WEBVTT

00:01:29.872 --> 00:01:31.557
Susjedstvo dolazi

00:01:31.557 --> 00:01:34.058
i suosjeća s majkom,

00:01:34.058 --> 00:01:39.152
i nitko ne čestita ocu.

00:01:39.152 --> 00:01:43.467
I majci je vrlo neugodno

00:01:43.467 --> 00:01:47.834
zato što ima djevojčicu.

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:51.094
Kada rodi prvu djevojčicu

00:01:51.094 --> 00:01:55.183
prvu kćer, tužna je.

00:01:55.183 --> 00:01:58.923
Kada rodi drugu kćer,

00:01:58.983 --> 00:02:01.756
ona je šokirana,